.TH tushuf 1 0.29.0 tclutils "Tcl Utility Command"
.SH NAME
tushuf \- thin CLI wrapper for tclutils::tushuf
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
tushuf ?-seed N? ?-count N? ?file?
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
The tushuf command is a thin wrapper around the Tcl package tclutils::tushuf. It is intended for interactive and scripting use when tclutils is installed from source. The primary API remains the Tcl library; see tushuf(n) for procedures, options, and semantics.
.PP
Run the script with tclsh:
.PP
.nf
tclsh bin/tushuf.tcl ...
.fi
